  },
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "l01",
      "at": 0.3,
      "who": "N",
      "shot": "k01",
      "text": "Three days. She got to school before the bell."
    },
    {
      "id": "l02",
      "at": 4.4,
      "who": "N",
      "shot": "k02",
      "text": "The art cupboard has everything nobody wants."
    },
    {
      "id": "l03",
      "at": 8.6,
      "who": "N",
      "shot": "k03",
      "text": "Gold foil, from last year's decorations."
    },
    {
      "id": "l04",
      "at": 12.0,
      "who": "N",
      "shot": "k04",
      "text": "Ribbon. Two good sheets of card. A packet of stars."
    },
    {
      "id": "l05",
      "at": 17.0,
      "who": "N",
      "shot": "k05",
      "text": "She stayed behind after everyone had gone home."
    },
    {
      "id": "l06",
      "at": 21.4,
      "who": "N",
      "shot": "k06",
      "text": "She cut, and glued, and started again twice."
    },
    {
      "id": "l07",
      "at": 25.8,
      "who": "N",
      "shot": "k07",
      "text": "And by the time the light went orange, it was finished."
    },
    {
      "id": "l08",
      "at": 31.0,
      "who": "N",
      "shot": "k08",
      "text": "It was better than the one she had imagined."
    },
    {
      "id": "l09",
      "at": 34.6,
      "who": "N",
      "shot": "k09",
      "text": "All that was left was to write his name on the front."
    },
    {
      "id": "l10",
      "at": 39.4,
      "who": "N",
      "shot": "k10",
      "text": "She picked up the pen."
    },
    {
      "id": "l11",
      "at": 41.8,
      "who": "N",
      "shot": "k10",
      "text": "And she stopped."
    },
    {
      "id": "l12",
      "at": 44.4,
      "who": "N",
      "shot": "k10",
      "text": "Because she did not know how to spell it."
    },
    {
      "id": "l13",
      "at": 48.4,
      "who": "N",
      "shot": "k10",
      "text": "She had only ever called him Papa."
    }
  ]
}
